Playwright (the fx-runner release's sidecar folder)
===================================================

The fx-runner release carries the playwright-core library, version 1.63.0, by Microsoft Corporation, under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, in a folder laid down beside the executable (fx-runner-playwright/node_modules/playwright-core).
The library's own LICENSE, NOTICE and ThirdPartyNotices.txt files travel inside that folder unchanged. It carries no browser.

Unicode data (packages/runner-protocol/vendor/unicode)
======================================================

