(packages/runner-protocol/src/confusables/skeletonTable.js): confusables.txt (Unicode Security Mechanisms, UTS #39, version 18.0.0, dated 2026-08-06,
checked in unchanged) and DefaultIgnorable.txt (the header and the Default_Ignorable_Code_Point section of DerivedCoreProperties.txt, version 18.0.0,
